	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="msg_oldc04r0201_old_champion_02"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>グッズケースを　あけると
ミュージカルで　ポケモンに　つける▽
いろとりどりの　グッズが　たくさん▼
よし！　それでは　さっそく
レッツ　ドレスアップで　ございます！▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-11-15T07:03:55" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-11-15T06:29:30" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>グッズケースを　あけると
ミュージカルで　ポケモンに　つける▽
色とりどりの　グッズが　たくさん▼
よし！　それでは　さっそく
レッツ　ドレスアップで　ございます！▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-11-15T07:08:25" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-11-15T06:29:30" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<CommentCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Comment>♂
・一歩前進
・続けて</Comment>
			<CommentModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-11-15T06:57:41" />
		</CommentCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Character">
			<Text>GENTLEMAN
＝オーナー</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-11-15T06:28:03" />
		</AttributeCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Importance">
			<Text>A</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2012-01-09T09:04:36" />
		</AttributeCell>
		<ExtraCell
			DataHolder="f803f354-0c78-4e1d-a1a9-1525faa0efba">
			<CellData>#80ff80</CellData>
