	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="msg_oldc04r0201_old_champion_03"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>あたまに　にあう　シルクハットは
エレガントな　グッズなのです！▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-11-15T06:44:48" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-11-15T06:29:30" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>頭に　似合う　シルクハットは
エレガントな　グッズなのです！▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-11-15T07:08:32" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-11-15T06:29:30" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<CommentCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Comment>♂
・その場で回転してから
　メッセージ表示
・続けて</Comment>
			<CommentModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-11-15T06:51:53" />
		</CommentCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Character">
			<Text>GENTLEMAN
＝オーナー</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
