				Time="2011-11-15T06:29:30" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>マラカス　マラカス　マラカス
腕に　持たせたら　ユニークですね▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-11-15T07:09:03" />
